  "title": "Easy-Peel Hard-\"Boiled\" Eggs",
  "description": "Instead of cooking in a pot of boiling water, these hard-cooked eggs are steamed, resulting in easy-peel eggs with no green yolks.",
  "authors": [
    "cerberus"
